# ImageKit.io Configuration
# 1. Sign up for free at https://imagekit.io (20GB free bandwidth/month)
# 2. Find your "URL-endpoint" in the ImageKit dashboard (e.g. https://ik.imagekit.io/your_id)
# 3. Replace the demo URL below with your endpoint:

VITE_IMAGEKIT_URL_ENDPOINT=https://ik.imagekit.io/demo
